OL,5,G1000 Cerys Matthews
OL,6,     FCerys hosts your Sunday sonic and
OL,7,     Fcultural adventure. She talks WWII
OL,8,     Fcode breaking with the team from
OL,9,     FBletchley Park, and unearthing
OL,10,     FAfrican recordings with musician
OL,11,     FDele Sosimi.
OL,12,G1300 Marc Riley's Finest Hour
OL,13,     FMarc Riley brings you some Tenuous
OL,14,     FLinks, where every tune connects,
OL,15,     Fsomehow, to the next. Cue great
OL,16,     Fmusic, obscure facts and the risk
OL,17,     Fof the occasional appalling pun.
